[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195135021","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109694#issuecomment-3195135021","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109694","id":3195135021,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-ceQt","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T05:21:50Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T05:23:20Z","body":"This completely breaks the editor for me in Windows 10 (1803)\r\nIt forces Godot into single window mode (so the picker works now.)\r\n\r\nAnd it **doesn't run the game** anymore.\r\nBecause it is forcing single window mode, embed is now disabled. \r\nAnd trying to run the game will result into nothing.\r\n\r\nClicking on Run says something is running but nothing happens.\r\n\r\nI think it is trying to embed the game because single window mode is disabled in the EditorSettings, but this PR forces single window on older windows and it all breaks.\r\n\r\nI don't think this **fix is worth it if it would make me lose the ability to run the engine with multiple windows**.\r\n\r\nHere's a video of the problem.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/edef9720-9b1b-4d05-b2ba-daecd217ed81\r\n\r\n---\r\nAlso tested the latest master, so this issue is because of this PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195135021/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195156350","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109694#issuecomment-3195156350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109694","id":3195156350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-cjd-","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T05:33:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T05:34:32Z","body":"It can't force editor into single window mode, doing so require editor restart. Look at the Editor Setting window title bar, it is already in the single window mode at the beginning of your recording.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195156350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195178569","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109694#issuecomment-3195178569","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109694","id":3195178569,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-co5J","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T05:44:19Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T05:44:19Z","body":"> It can't force editor into single window mode, doing so require editor restart. Look at the Editor Setting window title bar, it is already in the single window mode at the beginning of your recording.\r\n\r\nYeah, what I meant is... Godot starts up in single window mode even though the EditorSettings says it should not.\r\nIt always starts in single window mode in this PR no matter the config.\r\n\r\nAlso, sometimes the **editor just refuses to open up now**\r\nIt shows the console log, but nothing opens. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"972\" height=\"81\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/741f9228-a6c1-4820-9a60-94bed5fa7206\" />\r\n\r\nFor example, I can't open the Godot's Project Manager.\r\nBut I can open the project directly by dragging the \"project.godot\" file.\r\nUntil something happens and I can't open it anymore.\r\n\r\nDeleting the .godot folder makes the project **openable** again.\r\nBut the same .godot folder **opens just fine** in other versions of Godot and the latest master\r\n\r\nHere is the bugged project for reference.\r\n\r\n[bugged project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21828126/bugged.project.zip)\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what causes this, as far as I know I just created and empty scene, added the sprite, changed the modulate and tried to run it a few times. But I tried repeating these steps and its inconsistent whether it breaks the project or not.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195178569/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195255621","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109694#issuecomment-3195255621","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109694","id":3195255621,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-c7tF","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T06:09:35Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T07:05:34Z","body":"Sorry for the double post, but I think this is important.\r\n\r\nI managed to pin-point the cause of Godot not being able to start anymore in this PR.\r\nIt seems to be caused by **.godot/editor/editor_layout.cfg**.\r\n\r\nMore specifically the line:\r\n```\r\n[EditorWindow]\r\n\r\nmode=\"windowed\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf Godot tries to start in **windowed mode**.... it just doesn't start and hangs.\r\nWhich is why the Project Manager doesn't work, and the inconsistent project I had not opening anymore. (because sometimes I would close the project while it was not maximazed)\r\n\r\n---\r\nBut again, this probably only happens on very old windows 10 (1803).\r\nAnd I can still use the ColorPicker by setting the single window mode editor when needed, while still keeping the ability to use multi-window.\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195255621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3195267255","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109694#issuecomment-3195267255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109694","id":3195267255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-c-i3","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":